    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WHEN IT RUNS\n**What:** Two ways in. A timer every 15 minutes builds the pages. A GET link serves a page to the owner.\n**Needs:** Nothing. The link looks like /webhook/roadmap?s=<project>&k=<key>.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 536,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Sticky: WHEN IT RUNS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "le-note-01"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETTINGS\n**What:** Holds every setting in one place. Tells a page request from a timer run.\n**Needs:** Config keys: kill, dry_run, projects_json.",
